  bm_1230_warofprinces: "Dark Ages: Vampire"
  bm_1230_warofprinces_desc: "The War of Princes is the period of conflict in Cainite history that began shortly after the fall of Constantinople to the Fourth Crusade in 1204. The term refers to the conflicts over territory that the various princes of Europe fought after the end of the Long Night.\n\nThe War of Princes began shortly before the Inquisition was formed. Although the Inquisitors were initially used as tools by the elders, they soon became a greater threat to the Cainites than the Cainites were to themselves. Although it is not clear exactly when the War of Princes ended, it would have likely been forced to a conclusion with the advent of the Anarch Revolt, if not sooner.\n\n#bold Will you alone stand as victor at this War's end? Or will the tide of humanity wash your clan away as they turn against their rightful masters?#!"
  bookmark_warofprinces_montano: "Montano"
@@ -474,19 +475,19 @@
  bookmark_warofprinces_wang_kyu: "Wang Kyu"
  bookmark_warofprinces_wang_kyu_desc: "The head of an important regional family in life, Wang Kyu schemed several times to take power but was foiled at every turn before ending decapitated. Still a willful man, his return as a Kindred of the East didn't deter him.\nUsing the recent burning of P'yong'yang after a failed religious rebellion, Wang Kyu ended up being the quickest to seize the opportunity and proclaimed himself Ancestor of the powerful city. A lofty position not yet recognized by the Azure Dragon Court of Korea.\n\n#bold You know how to take advantage of crisis and, with the Azure Dragon Court showing signs of weakness, this might be time to seize what was denied to you several centuries ago.#!"
  bookmark_warofprinces_soo_kyung_ahn: "Soo-kyung Ahn"
- bookmark_warofprinces_soo_kyung_ahn_desc: "The bastard daughter of the Great Sage Xue, a goddess trapped in a mortal form, a dragon in slumber, Soo-kyung Ahn can tell you as many tales of her origins as you want to hear. The truth is, she doesn't know herself. The fact that she escaped the [UmbraGlossaryLocalized('yomi_wan','Yomi Hells')] with powerful artifacts that she is still studying to this day lays credence to some of these tales.\nSoo-kyung is a skilled diplomat and a respected go-between Korean Ancestors. As such, as the Azure Dragon Court enters a period of crisis, many are turning to her to see if she will add "Ancestor of Korea" to her resume.\n\n#bold Will you stake your claim over Korea using your contacts? Or will you focus on uncovering your past? The next chapter of your story is yours.#!"
+ bookmark_warofprinces_soo_kyung_ahn_desc: "The bastard daughter of the Great Sage Xue, a goddess trapped in a mortal form, a dragon in slumber, Soo-kyung Ahn can tell you as many tales of her origins as you want to hear. The truth is, she doesn't know herself. The fact that she escaped the [UmbraGlossaryLocalized('yomi_wan','Yomi Hells')] with powerful artifacts that she is still studying to this day lays credence to some of these tales.\nSoo-kyung is a skilled diplomat and a respected go-between for Korean Ancestors. As such, as the Azure Dragon Court enters a period of crisis, many are turning to her to see if she will add \"Ancestor of Korea\" to her resume.\n\n#bold Will you stake your claim over Korea using your contacts? Or will you focus on uncovering your past? The next chapter of your story is yours.#!"
  bookmark_warofprinces_wu_zetian: "Wu Zetian"
- bookmark_warofprinces_wu_zetian_desc: "The only recognized reigning Empress of China was a willful woman and it was thus little surprise that she escaped the [UmbraGlossaryLocalized('yomi_wan','Yomi Hells')] to become a Kindred of the East. As such a high profile newcomer, her education in the ways of the night has been entrusted to the best teachers of the Shaolin Monastery of Luoyang.\nSo far, Wu Zetian has been a diligent and dutiful student. Her progress is being watched closely with even the most jaded Ancestor wondering if the "Holy Emperor" will have a career as remarkable among the August Courts as she had in life.\n\n#bold This new society you are learning about is watching you closely. You might have to wait for a moment of crisis before making a move. You know full well what they say about times of chaos after all...#!"
+ bookmark_warofprinces_wu_zetian_desc: "The only recognized reigning Empress of China was a willful woman and it was thus little surprise that she escaped the [UmbraGlossaryLocalized('yomi_wan','Yomi Hells')] to become a Kindred of the East. As such a high-profile newcomer, her education in the ways of the night has been entrusted to the best teachers of the Shaolin Monastery of Luoyang.\nSo far, Wu Zetian has been a diligent and dutiful student. Her progress is being watched closely with even the most jaded Ancestor wondering if the \"Holy Emperor\" will have a career as remarkable among the August Courts as she had in life.\n\n#bold This new society you are learning about is watching you closely. You might have to wait for a moment of crisis before making a move. You know full well what they say about times of chaos after all...#!"
  bookmark_warofprinces_shou: "Shou"
- bookmark_warofprinces_shou_desc: "The infamous "Flame-Eater" of Southern China is perhaps the most powerful $pod_akuma$ (infernalist) active. With her powerbase far from the most powerful August Courts, Shou has been a plague for centuries in the region though luckily acting more as a twisted mentor to other $pod_akuma$ than truly trying to expand her influence.\nSome worry that, with the current collapse of the Courts, this small blessing might not be so true anymore...\n\n#bold Raiding the coasts and being worshiped as a dark deity by small villages has been fun so far but this won't bring the [UmbraGlossaryLocalized('yomi_wan','Yomi Hells')] to Earth. If you want to be the one to open the way for the [Glossary('Demon Emperor','podgloss.demonemperor')], more direct action will be needed...#!"
+ bookmark_warofprinces_shou_desc: "The infamous \"Flame-Eater\" of Southern China is perhaps the most powerful $pod_akuma$ (infernalist) active. With her powerbase far from the most powerful August Courts, Shou has been a plague for centuries in the region, though luckily acting more as a twisted mentor to other $pod_akuma$ than truly trying to expand her influence.\nSome worry that, with the current collapse of the Courts, this small blessing might not be so true anymore...\n\n#bold Raiding the coasts and being worshipped as a dark deity by small villages has been fun so far, but this won't bring the [UmbraGlossaryLocalized('yomi_wan','Yomi Hells')] to Earth. If you want to be the one to open the way for the [Glossary('Demon Emperor','podgloss.demonemperor')], more direct action will be needed...#!"
  bookmark_warofprinces_tashimoto: "Tashimoto Hanko"
- bookmark_warofprinces_tashimoto_desc: "The most celebrated general of the Japanese Gaki ("vampires") is a mysterious man. While outwardly loyal and dedicated to the cause of ensuring Japan's independence from the mainlands Courts, rumors abound about where his tactical skills and formidable prowess truly come from.\nHanko, so far, hasn't been forced to provide more details about his nebulous past. If he was to fail however, difficult questions might remove Japan's foremost defender from his post.\n\n#bold What they don't know won't hurt them. What you do know however is that you have Japan's best interest at heart.\nEven when those interests don't align with the ruling families.#!" 
+ bookmark_warofprinces_tashimoto_desc: "The most celebrated general of the Japanese Gaki (\"vampires\") is a mysterious man. While outwardly loyal and dedicated to the cause of ensuring Japan's independence from the mainland Courts, rumors abound about where his tactical skills and formidable prowess truly come from.\nHanko, so far, hasn't been forced to provide more details about his nebulous past. If he was to fail however, difficult questions might remove Japan's foremost defender from his post.\n\n#bold What they don't know won't hurt them. What you do know however is that you have Japan's best interests at heart.\nEven when those interests don't align with the ruling families.#!" 
  bookmark_warofprinces_yukio: "Yukio"
- bookmark_warofprinces_yukio_desc: "Yukio is one of the few women who managed to escape [Glossary('Emma-O','podgloss.emmao')] dreadful [UmbraGlossaryLocalized('yomi_wan','Yomi Hell')]. Having formed a deep hatred for the most powerful [Glossary('Yama King','podgloss.yamaking')], Yukio started the excruciating training regimen of Kuro-sama, the master of Japanese assassins.\nWhile still very young to her second life, Yukio is determined to ace her training and become a weapon that even her demonic tormentor will learn to fear.\n\n#bold Kuro-sama's penalty for failing his training is death but you would have nothing less. You will succeed, you will become the best ninja Japan has ever seen and then you will end [Glossary('Emma-O','podgloss.emmao')] himself.#!" 
- bookmark_warofprinces_ma_hai_lan: "Ma Hai Lan"
- bookmark_warofprinces_ma_hai_lan_desc: "General Ma is an oddity among the more scholarly bend Chinese vampires. While many are oblivious to the threat posed by the [Glossary('Anda','podgloss.anda')] and the infernalists, Ma Hai Lan thinks that only decisive and, if necessary, brutal action can save the Chinese August Court.\nThinking that the current system needs a wake up call before it's too late, she has gathered other like minded young Kindred of the East to her side to prepare the future.\n\n#bold The August Courts are crumbling. Only your strength of will and sword-arm can save China from a tide of chaos.#!" 
