  bookmark_warofprinces_li_jue: "Li Jue"
- bookmark_warofprinces_li_jue_desc: "In another life, Li Jue was an influential warlord. Nowadays, he is the last line of defense of the fallen Black Tortoise Court against the horde of infernalists coming to finish the job.\nSeen as an heroic figure by a generation of young Kindred of the East, Li Jue knows that the task in front of him is immense.\nToo bad he was always too stubborn for knowing when to quit.\n\n#bold It seems you are always at the center of changing eras. This time however it seems you are fighting for a good cause.\nNot that you think that it will change much.#!" 
