- pod1230objectives.206.desc: "After a period of reconnaissance and improving their knowledge of the $pod_kueijin$, the [Glossary('Anda','podgloss.anda')] finally broke into China proper. While their invasion was obviously less visible and traumatic than the Mongol one, it was still a catastrophic event for the Chinese immortals who didn't have to content with determined outside threats since the Burning of the Books.\nBlind to the scale of the invasion and washed away by the [Glossary('Anda','podgloss.anda')]'s momentum, the first part of the war clearly turned to be a resounding success for the children of Dobrul.\n\nBoth sides know however that the war isn't over. China is a big place and its remaining Ancestors are now much more privy to the true threat coming from the north."
