- pod1230objectives.208.desc: "The [Glossary('Anda','podgloss.anda')] triumph is complete. Their policy of studying their foes and waiting for the right moment to strike proved successful. The jaded immortals of China underestimated them at the beginning before scrambling for defenses. But it was too little too late.\nThe [Glossary('Anda','podgloss.anda')]'s victory is perhaps even more impressive than their Mongol's counterparts. A relatively young and unknown bloodline a couple of centuries ago, they have washed away the dominance of the $pod_kueijin$ who have been enjoying their top spot in Asia for many millennia. Some say this victory is the sign of the turn of the Ages (or Gehenna depending whom you ask) but to the more objective observer, it is mainly the bold and innovative young taking from the indolent and stubborn old.\nAnd in the immortal world, there is few things more frightening than that.\n\nWhatever the case might be, China's nights now operate under a new master. Will the [Glossary('Anda','podgloss.anda')] continue their ride or settle in their new prosperous land? Only they know, for the world is their steppe."
- pod1230objectives.208.a: "Mother Itügen is proud." 
