  podintroductions.199.desc: "Lord Jean-Baptiste, unlife is looking quite good. Your start was rocky, but you bounced back nicely and are now one of France's most successful 'night entrepreneur'.\nYou provide quality entertainment for the highest sphere of mortal, and $pod_cainite$, politicians. There is money to be made, and if the saying about money and power is true, you are about to become very powerful very soon."
