  podintroductions.252.desc: "Wise Constancia, you have recently returned from your successful journey to Egypt where you managed to thwart the mad Lazarus' plans. Still, he was just one part of the many issues that plague $pod_clan$ Cappadocian. With Japhet busy trying to curtail your fickle grand-sire, it falls on you to act.\nThe Giovanni are the most pressing concern and needs to be curtailed before they get any ideas. The Lamia are outwardly loyal but their strange Lilith worship needs careful watching. Finally Lazarus has been stopped but he still lives, some of his cronies will likely try to awaken him which must not come to pass.\nClan Cappadocian's future hangs on your actions lady Constancia. Don't let the dark prophecies you experienced come to pass."
  podintroductions.252.a: "The future can change."
