- podintroductions.329.desc: "Empress Zetian, your arrival in the $pod_kueijin$ world has been a tremendous event for this jaded supernatural community. While no one of them would say it to your face, it is clear that they are watching your every move, wondering if you will make as much of an impact here as you did as Empress of China. For your part, you have been content learning about this strange August Court system, so different from mortal China and yet so close.\nFrom the confines of the Shaolin Monastery where you have been trained, you have heard the rumors of nomadic invaders from the north and infernalists from the inside threatening the seemingly endless peace of the Yellow Emperor Court. If a time of chaos is at hand, it is likely that the eyes watching you will be drawn elsewhere and then... well, then it might be time to choose your own destiny and ambition for your second life."
