- podintroductions.330.desc: "Brazen Shou, you have been, rightfully, the most feared $pod_akuma$ infernalist active in Asia for a long while. Despite many (short lived) alliances between the Yellow Emperor and Scarlet Phoenix Courts to destroy you, you are still there while they crumble under their own weakness.\nWhile this gives you an unique opportunity to expand your domain without the major courts being able to intervene, this also makes things... boring. Being worshiped by small villages and band of pirates will soon lose its luster if you have no "righteous hero" to burn to death from time to time. You will have to find an alternative source of "volunteers" as you wouldn't want to lose your nickname of Flame-Eater after all..."
