- podintroductions.331.desc: "Cunning Tashimoto, your rise to fame as the best undead Japanese general has been quick and impressive by all accounts. For many of your detractors, this might be the sign of a dark secret fueling this unprecedented event.\n\nTo be honest, they are actually right.\n\nBy all accounts, you are actually an infernalist $pod_akuma$ as you have sold your soul to [Glossary('Emma-O','podgloss.emmao')] in exchange for your improved prowess and masterful new powers. The thing is, in war and in dealing with demons, you never intend to play fair. As Japan is singing your praise and [Glossary('Emma-O','podgloss.emmao')] is rejoicing in having enticed you to his service, you are planning perhaps the greatest heist of history. It will take time to plan it out thoroughly. You wouldn't want to rush things.\n\nAfter all, your very soul is at stake."
