- PODcanon_chars.99.desc: "You have conquered Daisetsuzan. The desolate mountain peak where Kuro-sama trains his pupils is now a friend and no longer a stern teacher. Kuro-sama taught you every thing he knows about murder, from the planning of the act to the cold and calculated moment where your dagger pierces the heart of your target.\nSensei has always been cold and difficult to read and tonight is no exception. You face off against each other one last time as Kuro-sama evaluates your form and swordsplay, a mere formality at this point. After this duel, you are coldly sent off and said to never return to Daisetsuzan.\nYou bow your head and prepare to leave when, perhaps for the first time in all those years, Kuro-sama shows a hint of a proud smile as he says that he looks forward to hear about the day you fulfill your revenge.\n\nThen it is done, and you leave the mountain, no longer a student..."
