- podintroductions.333.desc: "General Ma, despite your young age for an immortal, you have already garnered quite the reputation. While your sternly disciplined mind has earned you praise from your elders, they are less fond of your critics of the Court system and thus have sent you to the frontline with the Black Tortoise Court.\nFrankly, it's a pointless assignment as you know that much bigger threats than inter Court warfare are lurking. Still, this is a good opportunity for you to hone your Heaven and Hell Legion, a disciplined force composed of other $pod_kueijin$ believing like you do in an orderly change of era by military might.\nIn this time of growing uncertainty, you are darkly confident that they will have more than enough time to prove themselves."
