  podintroductions.335.desc: "Fearless Piyau, you have achieved enlightenment during your time as a jungle recluse when observing a mantis devour her mate. The strength of the feminine essence is the only truth and extolling it to its monstrous extremes is the way to redemption for the $pod_kueijin$.\nAs you leave your jungle and see the Scarlet Phoenix Court in shambles, plagued by infernalist $pod_akuma$ and corrupt officials, you know what you have to do. Your fury, and the fury of your scorned sisters, will save the world. Those that submit and embrace the feminine essence will be spared. Those that don't will be gored, devoured or left to rot in the wake of your purge.\n\nIt is time. Time to remake the world in your image, in a tide of blood, lust and mayhem."
  podintroductions.335.a: "We will bathe in the blood of men."
