- PODcanon_chars.100.desc: "Fearsome Piyau, your first conquests are going well and more and more converts are gleefully joining the Passion Bloodflowers. This has showcased a growing issue however.\nWhile the [Glossary('Dharma','podgloss.dharma')] you created appears very simple on the outside, its tenets of indulgence and brazen disregard for rules can easily be misinterpreted and lead to useless rampage and Dharmic collapse. Thankfully, you are here to explain and teach these newcomers.\n\n #italic "The Passion Bloodflowers exalt femininity to liberate themselves and the next generations. They indulge in their every need because a need unsatisfied will leave one vulnerable to envy and doubt. Fight with all your might against the infernalist and the ones that want to subdue you and destroy this world. You live here, if it perishes, you perish as well.\nMake the [Glossary('Yama Kings','podgloss.yamaking')] see your rage and passion and quake in fear. Welcome the [Glossary('Demon Emperor','podgloss.demonemperor')] with fangs, claws, tooth and nails until he is dead or you are.\n\nThis is the wisdom in life. If you need any more than that, you are walking the wrong road. Sew your cunt shut and go become a Crane if you think that way.\nThe thunder knows only one word and that word shakes the entire world. When you have learned to live as thunder speaks, then you will know something." #!"
