- PODcanon_chars.101.desc: "Victorious Piyau, your latest triumphs on the battlefield have caused quite a stupor in the northern Courts that foolishly thought of you and your armies as a band of deranged lunatics with no appreciation for warfare. They forgot that you are the Red Dragon.\n\nThis title has been given to you after your complete mastery of the Dragon Dance, a Yang-laden battle trance that forms a graceful yet furious martial art. While you are the only one to have truly mastered it, your [Glossary('Wu','podgloss.wu')], the Flayed Monkeys, aren't very far behind and are all skilled combatants in their own rights.\n\nPersonal prowess isn't your only strong suit. While you scoff at the complicated "rules of warfare" of the northerners, your own philosophy proves as simple as it is effective.\nIf you can win, win quickly and decisively. If you cannot win, run. If you cannot run, fight as a cornered tiger.\nWhile the sophisticated Chinese Courts once laughed at these tenets, they are growing more and more silent as you are killing more infernalists in decades than they ever did in centuries. Concerned whispers are rising that your purge of Southeast Asia might only be the beginning of your ambitions.\n\nGood. If they fear you, you have already won."
