- PODcanon_chars.102.desc: "Heavenly Piyau, your victories know no bounds. Scores of $pod_akuma$ and indolent officials have fallen in your wake, making room for a new age of exalted femininity.\nSome would call your new Court an hellhole of savage and sadistic women but you know better. This is the true wisdom in life, the vision of sheer glory that will bring back Heaven's favor on its once misguided daughters.\nOnce you were merely an handful of devoted sisters and now entire realms follow your philosophy, tearing apart the corrupt patriarchy and replacing it with boundless hunger, lust and drive for bloodshed.\nAlready your triumph has reached the ears of far away August Courts and the Passion Bloodflowers are spreading farther than your wildest dreams ever imagined... and you are known for very wild dreams indeed.\n\nAs your sisters and daughters sing your name while triumphing from one battlefield to another, it makes you wonder. Why stop there?\n\nWhy not liberate the whole world?"
