  PODcanon_chars.102.a: "Eternal bloodshed to the Heavens."	
  
- podintroductions.336.desc: "Lady Sun, long gone from memories is your unfortunate encounter with Sun Tzu. You are now rightfully praised as the most skilled strategist the $pod_kueijin$ world has ever seen. Ancestors from the most exalted Courts would kill to have you as their general but you have been refusing each and every offer. Instead you wander the world, learning and teaching as you go. Your books are all a mandatory read for every disciple willing to embrace the art of war though, obviously, you keep the best tactics to yourself.\nNo time to rest on your laurels however, warfare is an ever evolving art after all and you wouldn't want to be left behind. The auspicious sword hasn't made her last surprising appearance on a distant battlefield."
