-nick_despair_eater_desc: "If there no hope in sight, is it not mercy to shatter any illusions of a better future?"
-nick_elder_leyak: "the Elder Leyak"
-nick_elder_leyak_desc: "Chief among Rangda's Generals, [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] is a twisted [Select_CString(CHARACTER.IsFemale,'mistress','master')] of contagion, drawing forth the smallest sniffles into body-breaking diseases."
-nick_prince_leyak: "the Leyak Prince"
-nick_prince_leyak_desc: "All manners of affliction and horrors fester and dwell within [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U]. More horrifyingly, [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] doesn't look the part..."
-nick_younger_leyak: "the Younger Leyak"
-nick_younger_leyak_desc: "All manner of diseases can flow from the myriad orifices of man. Rangda has charged her youngest with spreading it through the more 'enjoyable' vectors."
-nick_madonna_succulent: "[Select_CString(CHARACTER.IsFemale,'Madonna','Procurer')] of Succulent Tears"
-nick_madonna_succulent_desc: "The Pit of Salt and Iron is home to the 'finest' brothel in all the Realms. The [CHARACTER.Custom('WomanManGirlBoy')] who runs it is feared and desired in equal measure."
-nick_devil_fish: "the Devil-Fish"
-nick_devil_fish_desc: "Hell's Seas all fear the Mother of Pearl's Monster. Their myths don't do Hunger their real credit."
-nick_vanguard_phoenix: "Vanguard of the Phoenixes"
-nick_vanguard_phoenix_desc: "It is not the soldiers that first meet the foes. It is the assassins."
-nick_scourge_fiends: "Scourge of Fiends"
-nick_scourge_fiends_desc: "Something foul and twisted lurks in the shadow, that makes bodies aliens to their owners. Let these fiends fear the sound of Thunder."
-nick_godeater: "the Godeater"
-nick_godeater_desc: "If they want to delude themselves and pretent to be gods, let them. [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] will show them a god is rendered down just as easily as a pig is."
-nick_khan_veil: "the Khan's Veil"
-nick_khan_veil_desc: "Once upon a time, Yanling was the quiet behind the birth of an Imperial Court. Now, [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] simply desires the quiet of obscurity."
-nick_outrun_dawn: "Who Outruns the Dawn"
-nick_outrun_dawn_desc: "A messenger that can outrun the day is critical for those who need to act in the night, and [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] mastered that. But as paradigms change, even [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] may not be able to keep up."
-nick_general_rock: "the General's Rock"
-nick_general_rock_desc: "In life [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] married one of the greatest generals China ever had, and in death applied it against Hell. As the threat changes though, [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] may be outplayed..."
-nick_decorated_champion: "the Decorated Champion"
-nick_decorated_champion_desc: "Among all the Hungry Dead of the Black Tortoise Court, [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] stands head and shoulders above them in accolades. But now the greatest threat [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] has ever faced stands before [CHARACTER.GetHerHim]."
-nick_dull_eyed: "the Dull-Eyed"
-nick_dull_eyed_desc: "[CHARACTER.GetFirstNamePossessiveNoTooltip|U] white eyes clue to a blindness, and while it once might have been that, it may just as well be the weight of the world snuffing the light from them as well."
-nick_steppe_burner: "the Steppe Burner"
-nick_steppe_burner_desc: "All manner of undead fear fire. [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] is more than eager to reveal to them the fires of Hell."
-nick_undoubted: "the Undoubted"
-nick_undoubted_desc: "Doubt is the enemy of action and of glory. Why waste time thinking out your actions when you can just do them?"
-nick_gentle_sheperd: "the Gentle Shepherd"
-nick_gentle_sheperd_desc: "Among the pastoralists that support the Black Tortoise Court, [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] is the hand that guides them. But their gentle protector may not have what it takes in the face of Anda brutality."
-nick_hunters_confidant: "the Hunter's Confidant"
-nick_hunters_confidant_desc: "For all the horrors they have done, the Regretful Hunters need someone to vent to. [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] begrudgingly is their source to dump their secrets on."
-nick_overlord_doctor: "the Overlord's Doctor"
-nick_overlord_doctor_desc: "Once a Knight's Surgeon, given new purpose by a Wanderer. [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] is eager to see what new means of enlightenment the East has..."
-nick_sorrowless: "the Sorrowless"
-nick_sorrowless_desc: "In life, [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] was lost, wandering, and confused. In undeath, [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] has purpose, art and blood flowing forth from [CHARACTER.GetHerHim] in equal measure."
-nick_iron_fiend: "the Iron Fiend"
-nick_iron_fiend_desc: "Many seekers of perfection tend to stick to flesh and spirit. [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] branched off into more esoteric means of perfection."
-nick_yakshi_artisan: "the Yakshi Artisan"
-nick_yakshi_artisan_desc: "While most of the Tzimisce further west have their terrifying Szlachta, the Yakshi of the Indian Tzimisce are no less terrible. And most of them harken back to the work of [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U]."
-nick_shadow_greatness: "the Shadow of Greatness"
-nick_shadow_greatness_desc: "Learning from his few mistakes, Chandraputra saw fit to prime a true heir. [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] exceeded all expectations."
-nick_sovereign_exchange: "the Sovereign of Exchange"
-nick_sovereign_exchange_desc: "[CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] was born to an empire in its zenith, and in the night he would finance another in an everlasting war."
-nick_confounding_diplomat: "Confounding Diplomat"
-nick_confounding_diplomat_desc: "How [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] survived is a mystery to all. How [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] is so charming is flummoxing to all [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] speaks to."
-nick_boy_commander: "the [Select_CString(CHARACTER.IsFemale,'Girl','Boy')] Commander"
-nick_boy_commander_desc: "[CHARACTER.GetFirstNamePossessiveNoTooltip|U] youthful beauty will never escape [CHARACTER.GetHerHim]. [CHARACTER.GetSheHe|U] finds there is no better face to hide [CHARACTER.GetHerHis] true nature."
-nick_sanctum_keeper: "the Sanctum Keeper"
-nick_sanctum_keeper_desc: "While it would never be his place to embrace [CHARACTER.GetHerHim], Chandraputra would never deny [CHARACTER.GetHerHis] worth."
+ nick_rose_of_the_seven_sins: "Rose of the Seven Sins"
+ nick_rose_of_the_seven_sins_desc: "Rome has risen again. Not as empire, but as appetite."
+ nick_sculptor_of_thrones: "Sculptor of Thrones"
+ nick_sculptor_of_thrones_desc: "In Krakow, a new castle rises, its heart beating."
+ nick_la_rose_couronnee: "La Rose Couronnée"
+ nick_la_rose_couronnee_desc: "France blossoms once more, back in the hands of her rightful rulers."
+ nick_avenging_petal: "the Avenging Petal"
+ nick_avenging_petal_desc: "One petal fell. Two gods bled. The garden blooms again, fed by their blood."
+ nick_architect_of_splendor: "Architect of Splendor"
+ nick_architect_of_splendor_desc: "The Toreador dream, in the flesh, and covered in velvet."
+ nick_caretaker_of_dreams: "Caretaker of Dreams"
+ nick_caretaker_of_dreams_desc: "Cities may burn and angels may fall, but dreams endure."
+ nick_second_seraph: "the Second Seraph"
+ nick_second_seraph_desc: "Cities may burn and angels may fall, but dreams endure."
+ nick_western_warden: "the Western Warden"
+ nick_western_warden_desc: "Few people would hate mortal institutions more than someone once condemned to the bottom."
+ nick_godly_shepherd: "the Godly Shepherd"
+ nick_godly_shepherd_desc: "Dancing the line between Orthodox and Heresy, all things come to those patient enough and canny enough to grow them."
+ nick_illuminated: "the Illuminated"
+ nick_illuminated_desc: "Sakchai is an early adopter to a new faith in Southeast Asia, with dubious loyalty. Time will tell how that plays out."
+ nick_golden_ambition: "Golden Ambition"
+ nick_golden_ambition_desc: "Only a dragon could stop Tilaka's rise. Good thing those don't exist right?"
+ nick_striking_gobetween: "Striking Go-Between"
+ nick_striking_gobetween_desc: "Descending from the Tiger Kings, Sriteja makes sure that the Ferocious People and the Ten Thousand Warriors play nice with each other."
+ nick_shrouded_diplomat: "Shrouded Diplomat"
+ nick_shrouded_diplomat_desc: "An aura of mystery hides a fiery conviction to stop evil from triumphing."
+ nick_dragon_savior: "Dragon Savior"
+ nick_dragon_savior_desc: "A fancy title can sometimes cause more harm than good."
+ nick_excitable_center: "Excitable Center" 
+ nick_excitable_center_desc: "The center of the Golden Shroud [Glossary('Wu','podgloss.wu')] is a whirlwind of unbridled passions."
+ nick_oracle_storms: "the Oracle of Storms"
+ nick_oracle_storms_desc: "The perilous storms of the oceans spell death for many sailors. Shenyou's ability to mitigate this makes him invaluable."
+ nick_biting_sands: "the Biting Sands General"
+ nick_biting_sands_desc: "Mild and meek, made mighty and fierce. Even sand can fleece flesh, if spurred properly."
+ nick_golden_keeper: "the Golden Keeper"
+ nick_golden_keeper_desc: "Numerous threats lie in secret even among the 'secure' central courts. Lingyuan maintains the cohesion of the Courts of Jingxinan."
+ nick_yellow_flower: "the Yellow Flower"
+ nick_yellow_flower_desc: "Despite her teacher's zeal, Hayati doesn't see it working out in the long run. She finds success much more likely among those bold enough to seize their destiny in the center."
+ nick_voice_sanity: "Voice of Sanity"
+ nick_voice_sanity_desc: "All around her is chaos. It takes an even composure and fearsome will to remain sane in times like this."
+ nick_flaying_gales: "the Flaying Gales"
+ nick_flaying_gales_desc: "Stripped of everything, what can one have left? Xiaowan asks herself that every day, the emptiness stoking a fire."
+ nick_grey_glacier: "the Grey Glacier"
+ nick_grey_glacier_desc: "The Temple of Three Mountains oversees much. It takes a truly skilled sage to make sense of it all. Of course, he quite enjoys the benefits that come with it."
+ nick_scalpel_vengeance: "the Scalpel of Vengeance"
+ nick_scalpel_vengeance_desc: "One would believe doctors do no harm. Zongmin chooses to instead take what reduces wickedness in the world."
+ nick_whip_hurricane: "the Whip of the Hurricane"
+ nick_whip_hurricane_desc: "Call it what they want, the disciples of the mantis are just as lost as the main courts. Yushi specializes in breaking them."
+ nick_knife_breaker: "the Knife Breaker"
+ nick_knife_breaker_desc: "She sees a charred god of vile blood on a black throne, atop a mountain in the west amidst an ocean of broken knives. Aiqin is sure this is the [Glossary('Demon Emperor','podgloss.demonemperor')]... can she even oppose them?"
+ nick_troubled_noro: "Troubled Noro"
+ nick_troubled_noro_desc: "If Amamikyu has plans for her lost priestess, she hasn't made them clear enough to ease Umikana's mind."
+ nick_unlikely_ancestor: "Unlikely Ancestor"
+ nick_unlikely_ancestor_desc: "Sometimes, you are the only one that can get the job done. No matter how unqualified you might be."
+ nick_scarlet_seas: "of the Scarlet Seas"
+ nick_scarlet_seas_desc: "While it took the world from her, the seas won't keep Dara down anymore."
+ nick_crimsom_razor: "the Crimson Razor"
+ nick_crimsom_razor_desc: "Suryani's sharp blade is rarely clean. There is blood to be split if evil is to be defeated."
+ nick_golden_appetites: "of Golden Appetites"
+ nick_golden_appetites_desc: "A bond shared in the forbidden taste could spell doom for an entire region."
+ nick_eastern_vanguard: "Eastern Vanguard"
+ nick_eastern_vanguard_desc: "China won't be brought low by rash action. Slow and methodical tactics will pave the way for the horde's victory."
+ nick_smiling_envoy: "Smiling Envoy"
+ nick_smiling_envoy_desc: "Finally a foreigner that recognizes the $pod_kueijin$ inherent superiority! Surely nothing bad will come out of the constant debasing he has to endure..."
+ nick_simmering_vanguard: "Simmering Vanguard"
+ nick_simmering_vanguard_desc: "Saige wants revenge upon the whole world but she will be happy to settle for the destruction of the $pod_kueijin$ for now."
+ nick_courtly_bandit: "Courtly Bandit"
+ nick_courtly_bandit_desc: "When thrown into two competing behemoths, the wise thief knows to look only for himself."
+ nick_bjornson: "Bjornson"
+ nick_lady_of_the_blackwoods: "Lady of the Black Woods"
+ nick_of_the_white_hands: "of the White Hands"
+ nick_sanguine_daimyo: "the Sanguine Daimyo"
+ nick_gardener: "the Gardener"
+ nick_green_gold: "of Green and Gold"
+ nick_green_gold_desc: "Seok's destiny might lies far away from Korea. Ambition knows no frontier after all."
+ nick_tired_young_man: "Tired Young Man"
+ nick_tired_young_man_desc: "While he will look young forever, the spark of rebellion and hope has long gone out in Gwang Hwa's heart."
+ nick_ceremonial_sword: "the Ceremonial Sword"
+ nick_ceremonial_sword_desc: "Ji So's annoyance at being a trophy warrior is gnawing at her. Few know what will be found once there is nothing left to chew on."
+ nick_azure_threads: "of the Azure Threads"
+ nick_azure_threads_desc: "Bo Hui sees the political threads wherever she looks. She aspires to master them all."
+ nick_jade_father: "the Jade Father"
+ nick_jade_father_desc: "One so indispensable as Yeong can only live a long and prosperous life. As long as his past doesn't catch up."
+ nick_ambitious_toppler: "Ambitious Carrion"
+ nick_ambitious_toppler_desc: "Someone has to make sure the Courts crumble when their time comes. Someone also has to rule the ruined rubble afterwards."
+ nick_bane_wicked: "Bane of the Wicked"
+ nick_bane_wicked_desc: "The [Glossary('Wicked City','podgloss.wickedcity')] will be torn down one stone at a time until silence finally reigns."
+ nick_first_shikome: "First of the Shikome"
+ nick_first_shikome_desc: "Still uniquely perfect to this day, Kiyoko anticipates the day when her lord will be able to create more sisters for her..."
+ nick_soul_kakuri: "Soul of Kakuri"
+ nick_soul_kakuri_desc: "The keeper of the Ainu dead strayed from his path. But perhaps even the \"Daimyo of the Dark\" can be shown a guiding light."
+ nick_cold_fire_shikome: "Cold Fire Shikome"
+ nick_cold_fire_shikome_desc: "[Glossary('Shikome','podgloss.shikome')] are cold creatures, but one can see Ieko's temper flaring even in her extreme Yin charged state."
+ nick_scarlet_friend: "Scarlet Friend"
+ nick_scarlet_friend_desc: "Nongkhai has a long memory. The help provided by the Scarlet Phoenix Court in his time of need won't be forgotten easily."
+ nick_wise_dragon_north: "Wise Dragon of the North"
+ nick_wise_dragon_north_desc: "Watching the winds of mortal dynasties come and go, in an apparently unending tempest of life and death."
+ nick_radiant_light: "Radiant Light"
+ nick_radiant_light_desc: "Protecting the pure lands by going on the offensive against those too close for comfort, [CHARACTER.GetFirstNamePossessiveNoTooltip|U] appearance is heralded by the coming of the sun."
+ nick_dinosaur_king: "the Last Dinosaur [Select_CString(CHARACTER.IsFemale,'Queen','King')]"
+ nick_dinosaur_king_desc: "[CHARACTER.GetSheHe|U] has been there since the beginning. Many think [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] will be there at the end."
+ nick_destroyer_ignorance: "Destroyer of Ignorance"
+ nick_destroyer_ignorance_desc: "The Celestial Tribe is not well known for its warriors. In [CHARACTER.GetHerHis] short tenure, [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] has already proven they don't need them."
+ nick_lord_people: "Lord of the People"
+ nick_lord_people_desc: "[CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] is rather keen on the Celestial Tribe's truth that the Hungry Dead are gods. Which one [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] is isn't clear though..."
+ nick_fashioner_artistry: "Fashioner of Artistry"
+ nick_fashioner_artistry_desc: "The forge is both a place of industry and war. The true artisan knows how to sing both its songs."
+ nick_rakshasha_break: "the Rakshasha Who Didn't Break"
+ nick_rakshasha_break_desc: "[CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] could have have been an [Select_CString(CHARACTER.IsFemale,'Empress','Emperor')]. [CHARACTER.GetSheHe|U] dares to be a [Select_CString(CHARACTER.IsFemale,'Goddess','God')]."
+ nick_necessary_monster: "the Necessary Monster"
+ nick_necessary_monster_desc: "[Select_CString(CHARACTER.IsFemale,'Sister','Brother')] to the King of the Demon City... at least so [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] claims."
+ nick_little_goddess: "the Little [Select_CString(CHARACTER.IsFemale,'Goddess','God')]"
+ nick_little_goddess_desc: "So many Godlings aspire to something grand. [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] is content just to protect what has always mattered to [CHARACTER. GetHerHim]."
+ nick_priestess_aravan: "[Select_CString(CHARACTER.IsFemale,'Priestess','Priest')] of Aravan"
+ nick_priestess_aravan_desc: "The Rising Phoenixes swear themselves to protect their communities. While that means something different for [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U], [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] is no less determined to follow it."
+ nick_raksha_queen: "the Raksha [Select_CString(CHARACTER.IsFemale,'Queen','King')]"
+ nick_raksha_queen_desc: "Hell hath no fury like a [CHARACTER.Custom('WomanManGirlBoy')] scorned. [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] is waiting for the right moment to teach that to the man [CHARACTER.GetSheHe] once saw as a father."
+ nick_lanka_enigma: "Lanka's Enigma"
+ nick_lanka_enigma_desc: "[CHARACTER.GetFirstNamePossessiveNoTooltip|U] loyalties might end up playing a critical role in the fate of the Demon City."
+ nick_hellist_arrivist: "Hellish Upstart"
+ nick_hellist_arrivist_desc: "If cutting corners was an art, there would be no master more skilled than [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U]."
+ nick_boiling_reaper: "the Boiling Reaper"
+ nick_boiling_reaper_desc: "Hluh's foremost $pod_akuma$ is a towering monster worthy of the dreadful reputation of [CHARACTER.GetHerHis] monstrous master."
+ nick_feverish_zealot: "Feverish Zealot"
+ nick_feverish_zealot_desc: "As the Monarchs of disease fight one another, [CHARACTER.GetFirstNameNoTooltip|U] chose [CHARACTER.GetHerHis] side to never relive what [CHARACTER. GetSheHe] had to endure."
+ nick_despair_eater: "Despair-Eater"
+ nick_despair_eater_desc: "If there no hope in sight, is it not mercy to shatter any illusions of a better future?"
