+ pathofstars_desc: "A twisted version of the Path of Metamorphosis, the followers of the Path of Stars seek perfection and service to a new master not just by perfection of the self, but perfection of the world. Suffering is essence, a resource to be extracted. So to truly ascend, one must make suffering mundane, make it as easy to barter with as coin, and so commonplace no one thinks to challenge it. To be a Seeker is not just to uplift yourself, but show the whole world what it is truly worth." 
  
  
